<title>BELGIUM: Chirac sees no EMU differences between Bonn, Paris.</title>
<headline>Chirac sees no EMU differences between Bonn, Paris.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac said on Thursday he saw no differences in the way France and Germany viewed economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
<p>&quot;I can't see today differences between the French and German government,&quot; Chirac told a news conference following a meeting with the European Commission. - Brussels newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
